      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e56898bb42b6a18de55abc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢各位的声援。在决赛中，\n我发誓会为大家献上至高无上的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2fb09956f6a12adb2715d1cc07db7d4068e2d232eb20912fadc4b9388c3f79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a33eb21e40c80e8c507553",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "徹底した自己管理とシミュレーションを経て\\n掴んだ勝利――感動もひとしおです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0725d8d3c8157288ffe211f5a51d4bcf1f3940b0f6c170ddd107e6d49ea5d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe610375ebbed64b6070e315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，但这并不是终点。要将这场胜利中\n得到的东西带向未来——我还在路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ff8ada49eaf2510e06cf6195b04a3af44ed21c5cdf373fc0a6d8aacbc87b62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e4102bd145b39edc91ace",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与您共步的未来，充满了希望与光芒。\n今天，我又一次加深了这份确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e00986881161cd0cd24e48ec5acf16cc4cbe64b74e872b2281159e4ae56214c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa6ee28fc0ac0498c38c9c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，但这并不是终点。要将这场胜利中\n得到的东西带向未来——我还在路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ff8ada49eaf2510e06cf6195b04a3af44ed21c5cdf373fc0a6d8aacbc87b62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f246a632ca20288f02e93679",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与您共步的未来，充满了希望与光芒。\n今天，我又一次加深了这份确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e00986881161cd0cd24e48ec5acf16cc4cbe64b74e872b2281159e4ae56214c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75bb0bd892fdd9b13dd5015",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，有那么快吗！？\n……咳咳。感谢您的夸奖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aab852be93e8ad4a7cfc37b10487601747650e633cd1ac1cf443d0ad5ecdd80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb75d94281154b4b9f90337",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会去订购新的兵书。\n为了将下一次的胜利，献给我的主君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ce10df6ca9c011c9365212380927091f67e85ad624b7ad2f75b602572e19d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d5c8c28e547f1f8707ea0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有的展开都在预料之中。\n只要在最后斩断一切就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbaa4ddb268c92603f0e13186470bf3636bed7c4bd05a5efb20054f94dab1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fad35d2c89fa59e21f3b926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员阁下会微笑着迎接我——\n一想到这，力量就涌上来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b73be1c5a947f35f4599711d858bc5b86106edb5a82f0390a583e45c8eea7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1257"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6b425cc05fbe278334be9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "主君还在等我复盘呢。\n得快点过去才行……失礼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4f2ac3289c06b32519ad5854dd1ef560a1be249850207b590f85a92d417b1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f559e877d6fd47111dea83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有的展开都在预料之中。\n只要在最后斩断一切就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbaa4ddb268c92603f0e13186470bf3636bed7c4bd05a5efb20054f94dab1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1259"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a5dae2b5d14349b3ca938c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ご興味がおありで？　私のメソッドで\\nよろしければお教えいたしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c170748c9c4eec832cad8c809d38b13fb0ab7151ab071c2eb25d299e41dd070",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60abc136d335268517f86a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员阁下会微笑着迎接我——\n一想到这，力量就涌上来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b73be1c5a947f35f4599711d858bc5b86106edb5a82f0390a583e45c8eea7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e2590017d53fbae3d5c8c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "主君还在等我复盘呢。\n得快点过去才行……失礼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4f2ac3289c06b32519ad5854dd1ef560a1be249850207b590f85a92d417b1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1be7dfd2198617ef69d29b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢各位的声援。如果有具体的感想\n我也随时欢迎，请务必……务必告诉我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c99a9980f6b30836afdda71cd2400a5d9e07b20210865030437e275db482951",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eea5e00145b99b991f8eedb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是转瞬之间将所有跑者一扫而空，\n比任何人都更快地驰骋到主君身边的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b699fdf8b5763f18042904a5b643536f37be7a73e22971ae47d5bf8ff282b6f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1263"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89bec451aa8e07c3016db145",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢各位的声援。如果有具体的感想\n我也随时欢迎，请务必……务必告诉我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c99a9980f6b30836afdda71cd2400a5d9e07b20210865030437e275db482951",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1264"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ef4f34775b42a03637b890",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是转瞬之间将所有跑者一扫而空，\n比任何人都更快地驰骋到主君身边的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b699fdf8b5763f18042904a5b643536f37be7a73e22971ae47d5bf8ff282b6f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1265"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98f142ac399d3a4f17089e47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是训练员给我的鼻炎药呢。\n畅快清爽，多亏了它我才能使出全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6606d6f79605d7e788b3e707748e4c35f51f1c005b5027db875307b0277827d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1266"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b16bfa1c18fec4c71d6ab32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。在养成俱乐部的教导下\n我从以前就很注意姿势呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6649671eaa2b6d4a23d755b6a52406282d4fdef3ae886f745e6ef4b1e399e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1101bb322620d8370b8c012f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。我一直很想尝尝\n那家店的动物甜点。就当是给自己的奖励啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4688468eb7c20dbce00a18725c1a2125ee6788cd37ef5a9e04e965b2d7d79e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1268"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7649a5b438bcabef46aa858b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能展现出点燃大家内心的奔跑真是太好了。\n『下一次，我也会赢的！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "723412b97994caa56d9e5c9b1bf6294a512500e7cb0942f841f4efc81134e703",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1269"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547f57e6ebe37749e6dfb0b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，排场超大的对吧。虽然大家都是\\n业余竞赛的同伴……但还是会觉得害羞呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60283a7fd819e8a9f89fae1fed24e66dd5a86b5e78ece2ee22109df67eaf164",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27282efa12e86d104e06a3f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以这场胜利为跳板，\n迈向更高的高度。我们两人都燃起了最高昂的斗志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bdad0511e70347a5c1bd276d7e1647de139f6dd25459b1ec346d678a9a724e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1270"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ecbf427dfa4abb758765be2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。我一直很想尝尝\n那家店的动物甜点。就当是给自己的奖励啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4688468eb7c20dbce00a18725c1a2125ee6788cd37ef5a9e04e965b2d7d79e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17088c4c1597fec1eed0b57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能展现出点燃大家内心的奔跑真是太好了。\n『下一次，我也会赢的！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "723412b97994caa56d9e5c9b1bf6294a512500e7cb0942f841f4efc81134e703",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
