      "uid": "zhcn:a156e2dde86079bfdf1344ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其他赛事中也有很多状态不错的人。\n一切都要看决赛前的调整了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a1ef32cb03d97471707af43bd73eb5417a0a41c87d550328d24f9561470845d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1278"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d1eb5efd6885a097e768d41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收集对手的情报帮了大忙。\n将不确定因素降到最低是非常重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1beacc1f51415291a8c1f140d0bfe9dbc6d70821dc477af66b6c9aed333a626d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1279"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:171612f70a536448b0390bba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是……用自己的方式尽全力奔跑吧。\\n「我要做自己！」的想法很重要对吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "262bec439ca800fb68568e0daf1d6b61e1d331cad29fa41ce7cd0abaec484a3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc4f2360ed0e62359ad1081",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每个人都是动真格来赢的。\n没有一个对手是可以不加以防范的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c7f3b26580c2ac312264d6ea2843ec1e1f6e7e6bdd3f1dc91f981821b19a83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1280"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a6d6312132d757dc82ed5de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好好休养，以万全之姿去迎接吧。\n不留下疲劳才是第一位的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572beb4329137c72049793719cad1c4145d10c06b718e185bf7f2482b3c07cd8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8647d95d4a636be6faff8957",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对流动变化的局势，能够随机应变，也是因为\n有了底子。平时的积累才是关键所在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d53bbd46c113df4142c1f592afddc1cfba8b0ac5957a034b8286b582f3aee237",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1282"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab85cfed51032816aab14811",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每个人都是动真格来赢的。\n没有一个对手是可以不加以防范的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c7f3b26580c2ac312264d6ea2843ec1e1f6e7e6bdd3f1dc91f981821b19a83",
