      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e5e723464eb6e78047b65d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是呢……今天的话，苹果……\n苹果派的话！　应该能吃一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a686b4a9ea98eb48b756d1e1cfd098b2290563d56841dda8cd926e67efa4269",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74fe28ae34486c0547badc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……老实说，虽然也有过想要放弃的时候，\n但能坚持相信真是太好了。相信我积累下来的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f427bea25ba7deacef0fbde04d80e0d3a17fbe813df58bf54bf67b9e0ccd9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8de41c74b8d712b57250b67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多亏平常有做好健康管理所以还活跳跳的！\\n像昨天也做了大腿骨伸展操呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0afa6da0f6a7ac2d3bd6ee307cc72d958ddf69e10be5e9989ae38f50ccb33a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0d140adc8dbad50dce3745",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，最后直线的表现好像大受欢迎耶！\\n啊哈哈哈哈！咳咳，不能呼吸了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7de552251624dbc371c52f4b074a88d4fb043c3aa50aaac8371a06a57ce2ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ad63bd30ea413b3e7b21c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是呢……今天的话，苹果……\n苹果派的话！　应该能吃一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a686b4a9ea98eb48b756d1e1cfd098b2290563d56841dda8cd926e67efa4269",
