        "1301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fffbda6d97873bcb3a3ed3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。她们总是一次不落地来为我加油……\n有了她们的支持才有了今天的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1567eab37b767dad693850af74a57f7b2c0b4aead8e2004806a5573c50095f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e8fb4e7245003faa67f8d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。刚开始的时候特别辛苦。经常因为\n做饭做得太多而分发给附近的邻居呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "488c9973fa15094a920d001c83acb35370677509a10f063c61e83693a82ac5b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e52538325a2513a0527620",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然只是一些基础……因为我小时候，也是\n船桥特雷森的前辈教我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989f31688a110df21361bb63f227410e42c3430919009d562e6ba6eee4d9c295",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef4cb1cf504fae45b69449c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为是无意识的所以没什么特别的……啊，\n倒是一直有在注意，要展现出不愧对船桥代表之名的身姿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e167950d0a022def73044edd8f1b7b0e3cc551f433cac51c667860613e6e6ff7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f0fa855cdf1c672cf344c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "打算和家人还有老家的朋友们通个话……。\n这对我来说，是比什么都重要的活力源泉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26ca8dcd7ed9c0efa40751b07dfcf6b7fe6e720e9229f57a2d318a455aea296",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
